    "answer": {
      "short": "$x\\approx-5.82,\\,-1.14$ or $1.96$.",
      "worked": "Graph $y=x^3+5x^2-7x-11$ and $y=2$. Use the intersection tool to read the three $x$-coordinates:\n$$\\begin{align*}x&\\approx-5.819028\\ldots,\\,-1.140244\\ldots,\\,1.959272\\ldots\\\\x&\\approx-5.82,\\,-1.14,\\,1.96\\quad\\text{(2 decimal places).}\\end{align*}$$",
